---
import DashboardMock from "./DashboardMock.astro";
---

<section class="story" id="rhythm">
  <div class="wrap story__grid">
    <div class="story__pin">
      <DashboardMock />
      <p class="story__caption">Stays beside the work. Counts only while you are at the screen.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="story__chapters">
      <article>
        <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker__dot"></span>Why it exists</p>
        <h2 class="display">Your eyes work hard for you. Screens make them work worse.</h2>
        <p>
          Focused computer use often cuts blink rate in half. Sparse, uneven
          blinking is a known driver of digital eye strain — dryness, grit,
          fatigue, blurred vision — and it is easy not to notice until the eyes
          already hurt.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker__dot"></span>What rhythm means</p>
        <h2 class="display">Rate and regularity, together.</h2>
        <p>
          Rate is how often. Regularity is how steady. Enough blinks can still
          arrive in bursts and droughts; a slow but even pattern still leaves
          the surface dry. EyesRhythm folds both into the
          <strong>Ocular Rhythm Index</strong> (0–100). A healthy desk cadence
          is often around 15–20 blinks per minute.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker__dot"></span>The companion</p>
        <h2 class="display">It watches, scores, and, if you ask, gently nudges.</h2>
        <p>
          ORI on a compact window, with optional alert if it stays low and an
          optional beep on each blink. Practice is a two-minute coach so the
          habit is easier to feel. A wellness companion, not a medical device —
          lasting discomfort belongs with an eye-care professional.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    background: var(--band);
    padding: clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px) 0;
  }

  .story__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .story__pin {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
  }

  .story__chapters {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  article {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-items: start;
    padding: 20px 0 28px;
  }

  article p {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  article strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .story__caption {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 22rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 980px) {
    .story__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 56px;
    }

    .story__pin {
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 28px);
    }

    article {
      min-height: 0;
      align-content: start;
      padding: 28px 0 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
